WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.840
<i>That day was a perfect, clear autumn day.</i>

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.000
<i>At Lucien's recommendation,</i>

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.850
<i>I was on my way to do some 
research for </i>Miracle Finder<i>...</i>

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:10.940
<i>At least, that's what I thought.</i>

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:18.180
So? Are you going to tell me 
where we're going now, Lucien?

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.850
You want to know that badly?

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:20.920
Well...

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.470
I mean, you're the one who said there
 was a mystical, mysterious place.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:28.450
That's why I'm here, all ready to go!

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.420
Wait a second... Were you lying?

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.430
Um, well... Will you allow me to explain?

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.740
You've been announcing one popular 
topic after another lately.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.980
Your company is on the rise.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.060
Well, thank you.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.000
Producing a number of shows

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.410
while simultaneously working
 as company president...

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.250
You've been incredibly busy.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.190
Well, we need to dig in 
and work hard right now.

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:54.610
However, there is one problem.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.380
It seems you haven't noticed,

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:02.500
but your talented, dependable 
employees cannot be fooled.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.360
They came to me to talk about you,

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:09.570
saying they're glad you work so hard, 
but they're worried you might collapse.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:12.480
Honestly...

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.510
They all worry too much.

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:18.830
A moderate amount of rest 
is necessary for any manager.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:20.910
When the time comes to 
make important decisions,

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:24.110
you need your brain to be working 
at optimum performance levels.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.050
Which is why...

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:29.100
I was hoping that you'd come 
on a picnic with me today.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:34.780
That way, they'll feel better, 
and I'll get to have a nice day off.

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:37.440
All right.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.460
Then, just for today, I'll forget 
about work and enjoy myself.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:42.460
Thank you, Lucien.

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:48.740
But... it really is a mysterious place.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:54.590
The place we're headed is a place 
where you can see a very special view.

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:59.540
<i>What waited for us beyond 
this beautiful scenery?</i>

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:02.310
<i>At that moment, only Lucien knew the answer.</i>

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:08.060
<i>But even he never could have 
imagined what was about to happen.</i>

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:19.410
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:19.410
~The Red Queen Hypothesis~

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:25.590
<i>In this world, there exist 
unique powers known as "Evol,"</i>

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:27.830
<i>which are possessed by a very few.</i>

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:32.250
<i>Among them, some chose to fight 
their fate, to fight the world.</i>

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.900
<i>This is the story of these young "Evolvers."</i>

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:55.000
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.380
"Beyond That Dream"

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.970
Where we're headed is still a ways off, right?

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:13.500
Are you sure this is where 
we should get off the bus?

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.650
The weather's nice. Let's walk a little.

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:19.190
You wanted to see the scenery, right?

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:27.370
"At first, he was just like a 
hundred thousand other foxes,

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.150
just a fox.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:32.830
But then we became friends,

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.050
and now he is the only one 
like him in the whole world,

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:37.380
a very special fox."

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:40.230
<i>The Little Prince</i>, right?

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:44.130
"The gold of the wheat 
will remind me of you...

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.910
And the sound of wind 
passing over the wheat fields

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:50.600
is something I'll grow to love..."

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.400
Oh, look!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:01.340
See? Doesn't it seem like 
a fox might sit there?

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.950
What's wrong?

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.500
It looks like it's hurt and can't walk.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.690
It's not a stray.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.090
It's just a kitten, so it can't have come very far.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.160
We have to find its owner!

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:25.220
Just wait. We'll take you home.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.660
Lucien, look after this little one.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:32.010
I'll go ask the people over there.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:34.830
Excuse me!

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.960
Oh, thank you.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:44.440
Aren't we lucky you were saved 
by such kind people, Mii-chan?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:48.450
Now, please come in. I'll make some tea.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.550
Oh, don't go to any trouble for us.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.560
No need for modesty. Come, now.

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:54.410
All right.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.610
How beautiful...

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.220
Thank you.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:05.660
Did you make all of these?

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:06.590
Yes.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:09.710
Oh! Let me give you a present as thanks.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:14.000
Oh, no! I couldn't accept 
something so lovely for nothing...

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:15.830
What are these?

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:20.100
They're charms. Ones that grant good luck.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:25.570
Would you be willing to teach 
me how to make them?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.530
Of course! Now, which one would be best...

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:32.000
Um, the simplest one, if you could...

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:04.450
So... this goes like this, and...

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:06.650
Huh?

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.110
One more time!

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:14.540
I heard that you ran into some trouble 
while investigating your old high school.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:16.970
They told you <i>that</i>, too?

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:21.640
It seems you're looking into
 something quite dangerous again.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:25.200
Knowing you, you must have 
been chasing after the truth

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.670
as hard as you could.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:32.620
That said, I'm not sure if knowing 
the truth always brings happiness.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:39.810
You may regret it if you run into danger or 
learn things you were happier not knowing.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:44.240
Thank you, Lucien, for worrying about me.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:48.280
But... I don't think I'll feel that way.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:51.350
It's true that it might be dangerous,

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:54.740
but it's far better than never knowing.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:55.820
After all...

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.140
No matter how cruel the truth is,

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.080
you can't overcome it 
unless you know it, right?

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:03.750
If you don't, no matter what 
you do, nothing will change.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.640
You can't move forward.

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.310
I couldn't stand that.

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:11.100
If there are Evolvers suffering, 
I want to help them.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:14.370
I don't want anyone else to 
fall victim like Papa did.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:16.310
I want to stop Black Swan.

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:26.730
Aw, I messed it up again!

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:30.330
Let me see it. I'll untangle it for you.

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.700
It's fine! I'll do it myself!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:35.050
Really? Then, please, take your time.

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.030
I'll do my best!

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:42.680
<i>Don't push yourself so hard when you're 
with me. Take your time growing up.</i>

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:58.640
Shaw.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.100
Was it you who called me out to this place?

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:06.060
Yeah, I have a warning for you.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.460
A message from Black Swan.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:14.400
They say, "If you value 
your life, stop interfering."

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.570
Wait, you're with Black Swan?!

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:21.410
Don't misunderstand. I haven't joined them.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.680
It's just that they're worth using.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.710
I took this job on in return, that's all.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.480
Don't you touch her!

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:42.970
I'm sure there's still more fun to be had, 
but should we call it quits for today?

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:46.610
I don't think you'll be able to protect 
anything that's important to you, but...

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:51.690
Well... if you really want to protect her, 
you'd best leave the force immediately.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:53.650
What do you mean?

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:58.400
Don't you know what happens 
to the people you capture?

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:02.300
They use pretentious words like 
"protective custody" and "crime deterrent,"

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.620
but the Task Force is just 
a bunch of executioners.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:12.130
You should be very careful...

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.750
so they don't execute you, too.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:24.060
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:29.060
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.080
There we go.

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.070
I did it!

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:43.410
Congratulations! Well done. 
It's outstanding work.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.420
Thanks!

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:47.090
Here, Lucien. It's a present.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:47.660
What?

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:52.370
I know it's after the fact, but thank you 
for all your help with <i>Miracle Finder</i>.

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:57.300
If you hadn't been on the show, 
we wouldn't have been able to continue.

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:02.930
When we first met, you asked me 
to show you my color, didn't you?

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:06.460
When I think back on it now, 
that was the first spark.

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:08.430
You're the one who pushed me forward.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.800
This is just a token of my gratitude.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:14.820
Keep it for good luck, if you'd like.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:19.790
You mean this is why you 
redid it over and over again?

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:20.750
Yes!

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:24.060
Though it still didn't turn out so good...

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:27.580
True. I couldn't call this well-made.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:30.500
But I love it.

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:33.500
It makes me very happy. Thank you.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.460
It really is beautiful!

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:51.890
So is this that "special view" you talked about?

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.130
No.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.210
Wow... It's amazing!

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:25.140
Do you... remember this place?

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:26.600
Huh?

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:35.850
<i>Why do I... suddenly feel... sleepy...</i>

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:42.360
I know you'll be able to remember...

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.940
the truth you're searching for...

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:50.430
and the promise we made that day,
sealed up in that jar.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:03.010
Huh?

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.850
Did I... fall asleep?

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:18.870
It seems smaller than it was before...

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:20.260
Am I imagining it?

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:26.030
That girl...

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:31.910
Hello!

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.680
Hello.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.130
Did you come here to draw?

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:42.440
Yeah. I come here to draw every day.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.190
Let me see!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.640
That's amazing...

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.990
That's amazing!

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.590
I love your drawings!

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:56.030
How old are you? What's your name?

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.560
I'm going to be five soon!

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.610
Oh, and I can even write my name now.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:02.410
See?

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:06.170
What's your name?

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:07.570
I'm Lucien.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.120
Lucien?

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.430
Do you remember?

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:11.290
Huh?

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.760
Wait... What's going on?

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:16.780
Who are those children?

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.420
It's so strange.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:22.060
It's nostalgic somehow, 
as if I've seen this before...

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:26.130
And that boy says he has 
the same name as you, Lucien...

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.320
I did it!

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:32.570
Here, this is for you. 
It's a little crooked, though.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.260
Thank you.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.500
Will you come here tomorrow, too?

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:37.360
Yes.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:39.000
Yay!

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:43.020
But this promise...

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:58.580
Wh-What is this?

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:11.220
Hello!

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:15.220
Hello. Are you waiting for the boy?

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.400
Yup.

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.230
The boy from yesterday.

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:20.860
He did say he would come back.

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:22.400
I don't think he's coming, though.

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:24.610
What? Why?

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.320
I can see tomorrow.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.130
What?

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:34.880
And I saw today, too.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.530
No matter how long I wait, he doesn't come.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:40.660
I just fold cranes by myself.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:43.200
My dreams always come true.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.670
Yours do, too, don't they?

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:48.630
That's why... you'll wake up soon.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.130
What... What are you saying?

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:56.270
Soon, he will be gone, 
and he won't come back.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:57.070
What?

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.590
Where is this?

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:26.670
Look out!

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.100
He's still alive!

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:46.850
Lucien?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.260
Are you all right?

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:01.160
Lucien... What just...

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.620
You were sleeping here the whole time.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:05.460
What?

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.660
You must have been 
more tired than I thought.

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.960
After you get home, you should rest.

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:13.180
W-Wait...

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:15.760
There was rain, and I saw an accident...

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.180
But that boy was...

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.920
You were dreaming.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.230
Lucien...

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:27.390
I'm sorry. I feel bad, 
but I can't see you home.

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:28.270
Drive, please.

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:35.350
<i>It can't be... I mean, that was...</i>

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:38.410
<i>All of that... it was a dream?</i>

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.680
possesses an Evol allowing teleportation.

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.680
says Black Swan was using parents as hostages.

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.680
currently held under restraint.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.680
Further whereabouts unknown

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:15.440
I hear you failed at 
awakening the Queen, Ares.

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:19.340
"People evolve through their 
interactions with other people."

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:21.970
That's your theory, isn't it?

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:24.470
Humanity is endowed with a social nature,

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:28.220
so it has created a cooperative 
community and evolved.

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:30.610
That is the simple truth.

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:32.750
We must be able to take advantage of it.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.320
Very well.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:38.090
We shall soon see whether 
your theory proves true.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:44.020
The time has come.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:45.520
Further whereabouts unknown

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:46.430
Further whereabouts unknown

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:47.480
whereabouts unknown

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:53.230
<i>No matter how cruel the truth may be,</i>

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:56.330
<i>the Queen is fighting with 
all her might to move forward.</i>

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:58.830
<i>Just as we expected...</i>

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.520
<i>No, with even greater speed.</i>

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:05.750
<i>According to the plan, I would 
invite her into the dream world</i>

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:07.810
<i>and bring back her memories.</i>

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:10.780
<i>It wasn't a complete awakening,</i>

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:13.670
<i>but I am certain that power 
is beginning to blossom.</i>

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:16.720
<i>Is that why I couldn't keep things in check?</i>

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:20.740
<i>It's the first time I thought 
I wouldn't be able to control her.</i>

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:23.870
<i>As a result, that dream...</i>

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.760
<i>The boy who lost both his 
parents in that accident,</i>

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:30.060
<i>and was the only one to survive it,</i>

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:35.020
<i>became the first manmade Evolver 
through the work of that organization.</i>

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:37.260
<i>And as a side effect,</i>

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.640
<i>he lost his emotions and 
all the color from his world...</i>

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:40.780
<i>or so he thought.</i>

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:42.240
<b>New Message 
</b>Lucien, are you okay?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:53.120
"The gold of the wheat 
will remind me of you...

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:59.600
And the sound of wind passing over 
the wheat fields is something... I'll..."

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.590
Lucien, are you okay?

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.590
You seemed a little off.
 I'm worried.

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:05.180
I'm fine.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.300
I'll be busy with experiments 
for a while. Sorry.

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:10.440
<i>If the boy I saw in the dream was Lucien...</i>

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:13.160
<i>Has he lived all alone this whole time?</i>

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:19.920
<i>Soon, he will be gone,
and he won't come back.</i>

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:24.670
Could it be... this time, Lucien's 
facing some kind of danger?

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.310
<i>Lucien is an Evolver.</i>

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.840
<i>It's possible he could get 
caught up in danger.</i>

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:34.240
<i>I don't know what Black Swan is plotting,</i>

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:35.950
<i>but I won't let them do that.</i>

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:38.840
Morning!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:39.930
President!

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.720
There's big, huge news!

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.380
H-Hold on, Kiki-chan.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.480
Anna-san? What's all the excitement about?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:48.690
An incredibly big break for 
us just dropped in our laps!

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:49.930
A big break?

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:55.500
HBS is looking to produce a variety 
game show in countries around the world,

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.380
and their first location 
is here in Loveland City!

00:20:58.380 --> 00:20:59.540
And...

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:02.780
they came to <i>us</i> to form 
a business partnership!

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.600
What?!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:06.830
By "HBS," you mean <i>the</i> HBS?!

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:09.120
The one with the highest variety 
show viewership in the US?

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.610
That huge American TV company?!

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:14.690
That's why it's huge news!

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:19.280
It seems that exclusive interview with 
Key was very popular in America, too.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:22.130
They want to work with
 the producer, meaning you!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.340
You're kidding.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.770
This is unbelievable!

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:29.600
"A ground-breaking variety game show 
everyone will want to watch,

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:32.290
welcoming guests from every walk of life!

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:35.540
And the first, celebrated guest will be...

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:40.150
Appearing like a comet, he built one of the 
biggest conglomerates from the ground up,

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:44.370
the young prince of the financial world, 
the darling of the age...

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:48.750
The man talked about more than any other,

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:51.090
the CEO of LFG"?!

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:24.940
<i>An abhorrent place, 
eating away at my heart...</i>

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:27.990
<i>So that your mind and
 emotions will be resolute,</i>

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:29.920
<i>I will wipe away your fears.</i>

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:31.460
<i>Episode seven,</i>

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:33.110
<i>"Connected Memories."</i>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:35.050
"Connected Memories"
